      "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.5/p@138411",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DUKE.\nI thank thee, Varrius, thou hast made good haste.\nCome, we will walk. There’s other of our friends\nWill greet us here anon. My gentle Varrius.",
